Description: clipboard history manager with search, pins and sync
 Clipdeck remembers what you copy so you can paste it again later. Press a
 shortcut, type a few letters to find a clip, and press Enter to paste it
 into the window you were using.
 .
 It keeps text, formatted text, images and copied files, lets you pin clips
 and sort them into groups, and can sync clips between computers over an
 encrypted connection. It works on X11 desktops such as Cinnamon, Xfce
 and MATE.
